    "howToPlay": "Utilize tesso to blast nile/olypmus comps before they can start accumlating stats. Tesso bombardment + ryujin generate stacks for odokuro and hachiman\n\nThis comp is best used in Olympus, Kami, Nile . Get taunt on tesso\n\nStat scalers | Namahage(early) | Sarutakhiko(mid) | Ryujin(late).\n\nWith tesso(r3) | cat(r1) + mortissa(r1) 8 shots(128 damage) | cat(r2) + mortissa(r2) 16 shots(256 damage) | cat(r3) + Mortissa(r3) 36 shots(576 damage)  | 4 shots * 16 damage * (Cat rank * Morissa rank)",
